+# Bridge sidecar. Its ports are the whole point of the container: socat binds 25
+# and 143 inside the pod and forwards to the bridge on 127.0.0.1:1025/1143, so an
+# IMAP client in this pod connects to `localhost:1143`. Renaming or removing the
+# `imap` port breaks the mail rule's imap_port without any other symptom.
